    {
      "id": "node-topic-gpu",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\ude80 Step 1A: GPU Acceleration Domain\n**[[topics/gpu-deployment/00-gpu-deployment-moc|GPU Deployment MOC \u2197]]**\n- **Target**: NVIDIA Ada, Blackwell, Orin Architecture\n- **Techniques**: CUDA Streams, FP8/FP16 Kernels, Graph Capture\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/gpu-deployment/README|GPU Production Deployment Playbook]]",
      "x": -1010,
      "y": -280,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-topic-fpga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \u26a1 Step 1B: FPGA Acceleration Domain\n**[[topics/fpga-deployment/00-fpga-deployment-moc|FPGA Deployment MOC \u2197]]**\n- **Target**: AMD Versal Gen 2, Zynq UltraScale+ MPSoC\n- **Techniques**: DPU Cores, FINN Dataflow, INT4/INT8 PTQ\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/fpga-deployment/README|FPGA Hardware Synthesis Playbook]]",
      "x": -1010,
      "y": -70,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-topic-rt",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \u23f1\ufe0f Step 1C: Hard Real-Time Systems\n**[[topics/real-time-systems/00-real-time-systems-moc|Real-Time Systems MOC \u2197]]**\n- **Target**: Deterministic p99 Latency (<10 ms robotics, <33 ms CV)\n- **Stack**: Linux PREEMPT_RT, Lock-Free Rings, ASIL-D ISO 26262\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/real-time-systems/README|Real-Time Systems Playbook]]",
      "x": -1010,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "1"
    },
