    },
    {
      "id": "node-cb-16",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfaf Step 3A: TensorRT 10 & CUDA Graphs\n**[[cookbooks/16-tensorrt-cuda-graphs/README|Cookbook 16: TensorRT Graphs Playbook \u2197]]**\n- **Feature**: Zero-CPU kernel launch overhead via `cudaGraphLaunch`\n- **Memory**: Pre-allocated zero-copy page-locked pinned memory\n- **Performance**: $<0.60\\text{ ms}$ ($1,724\\text{ FPS}$ on RTX 5090)",
      "x": -120,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cb-23",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd04 Step 3B: ONNX Runtime IOBinding\n**[[cookbooks/23-onnxruntime-iobinding/README|Cookbook 23: ORT IOBinding Playbook \u2197]]**\n- **Feature**: Direct device buffer mapping (eliminates CPU-GPU copies)\n- **Engine**: Cross-platform EPs (TensorRT, CUDA, OpenVINO, QNN)\n- **Speedup**: $1.85\\times$ end-to-end latency reduction",
      "x": -120,
      "y": -100,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cb-24",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Step 3C: Vulkan SC Safety-Critical Compute\n**[[cookbooks/24-vulkan-sc-safety-critical/README|Cookbook 24: Vulkan SC Playbook \u2197]]**\n- **Standard**: ISO 26262 ASIL-D / DO-178C avionics certification\n- **Architecture**: AOT pipeline cache + zero dynamic runtime memory\n- **Execution**: Deterministic offline compiled SPIR-V shaders",
      "x": -120,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cb-17",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \u26a1 Step 3D: AMD Quark Versal PTQ\n**[[cookbooks/17-amd-quark-versal-ptq/README|Cookbook 17: AMD Quark Playbook \u2197]]**\n- **Quantization**: SmoothQuant + AWQ outlier channel migration\n- **Precision**: INT4 AWQ / FP8 AIE-ML v2 graph export\n- **Target**: AMD Versal Gen 2 AI Engines (AIE-ML)",
      "x": -120,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 170,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-ipc",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Stage 4: Lock-Free Shared Memory & Hard RT Scheduling",
      "x": 330,
