    },
    {
      "id": "node-cb-03",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udce6 Step 4A: Iceoryx2 Zero-Copy Shared Memory\n**[[cookbooks/03-iceoryx2-zero-copy-ipc/README|Cookbook 03: Iceoryx2 Playbook \u2197]]**\n- **Transport**: POSIX shared memory (`/dev/shm`) lock-free ring\n- **Latency**: $0.85\\ \\mu\\text{s}$ transfer for $4\\text{K RGB}$ frames ($0\\text{ copies}$)\n- **Jitter**: P99 $<0.05\\ \\mu\\text{s}$ inter-process latency variance",
      "x": 370,
      "y": -110,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-cb-15",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \u23f1\ufe0f Step 4B: Real-Time RMS & EDF Task Scheduler\n**[[cookbooks/15-realtime-rms-edf-scheduler/README|Cookbook 15: Real-Time Scheduler Playbook \u2197]]**\n- **Policies**: Rate Monotonic (RMS) + Earliest Deadline First (EDF)\n- **Cert**: Liu & Layland theoretical utilization bounds ($U \\le 1.0$)\n- **Monitoring**: Microsecond tick simulation + zero deadline misses",
      "x": 370,
      "y": 110,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "5"
    },
